# "Tap it" is no cost and does not remove a blocker from combat (CR 506.4): Cathar Commando (3/1) attacks on turn 4, the
# Elf blocks, and Bot1 discards an Island to make it indestructible and tap it. The tapped Elf still deals its 3 damage
# (the Commando dies) and survives the Commando's 3 damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Iron-Shield Elf
Island x4
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Cathar Commando
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Iron-Shield Elf.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Cathar Commando.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Cathar Commando)
Bot1.Block(Iron-Shield Elf > Cathar Commando)
Bot1.Battlefield.Iron-Shield Elf.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Island)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Cathar Commando
Bot1.Battlefield.Iron-Shield Elf.Damage = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Iron-Shield Elf.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Island
